        "TileImage": "$($repository 37404add-fbf0-4698-9712-50ced4f4b46c).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, Agent. How was your vacation? \r\rA small cell of the Cyber Mafia called Pr0xy is getting ready for a digital bank heist that could cripple the local economy and cost the bank and its shareholders millions. In addition to eliminating the three members, you need to recover the parcel-bomb in the safety deposit boxes, as well as the Data Core. I trust you will see this done. \r\rGood luck, Agent. \r\r-Diana.",
